#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`bmm150` --- BMM150 3-axis magnetometer"
msgstr ":mod:`bmm150` --- BMM150 3-axis magnetometer"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:7
msgid ""
"Driver for the Bosch BMM150 3-axis geomagnetic sensor over I2C. On "
"construction the driver soft-resets the device, switches it into normal "
"operating mode at the requested ODR, and reads the trim registers used by "
"the Bosch compensation equations to convert raw readings into calibrated "
"magnetic-field values."
msgstr ""
"Driver untuk sensor geomagnetik 3-sumbu Bosch BMM150 melalui I2C. Saat "
"konstruksi, driver melakukan soft-reset perangkat, mengalihkannya ke mode "
"operasi normal pada ODR yang diminta, dan membaca register trim yang "
"digunakan oleh persamaan kompensasi Bosch untuk mengonversi pembacaan mentah"
" menjadi nilai medan magnet yang terkalibrasi."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:15
msgid ""
"SPI mode is not supported by this driver; passing a non-I2C bus raises "
"``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Mode SPI tidak didukung oleh driver ini; memberikan bus non-I2C akan "
"memunculkan ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:18
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Contoh::"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:31
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:35
msgid ""
"Construct a ``BMM150`` instance, soft-reset the chip, verify its chip ID, "
"configure it for normal mode at ``magnet_odr`` Hz and read the factory trim "
"registers."
msgstr ""
"Buat instans ``BMM150``\\ , soft-reset chip, verifikasi ID chip-nya, "
"konfigurasikan untuk mode normal pada ``magnet_odr`` Hz dan baca register "
"trim pabrik."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:39
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:40
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Bus :py:class:`machine.I2C` yang telah dikonfigurasi tempat sensor "
"terpasang."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:42
msgid "``cs``"
msgstr "``cs``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:43
msgid ""
"Reserved for SPI mode. Must be left as ``None``; SPI is not currently "
"implemented and supplying a non-I2C bus raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Dicadangkan untuk mode SPI. Harus dibiarkan sebagai ``None``\\ ; SPI saat "
"ini belum diimplementasikan dan memberikan bus non-I2C akan memunculkan "
"``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:47
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:48
msgid "7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x10``."
msgstr "Alamat I2C 7-bit perangkat. Defaultnya adalah ``0x10``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:50
msgid "``magnet_odr``"
msgstr "``magnet_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:51
msgid ""
"Magnetometer output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``2``, ``6``, ``8``, "
"``10``, ``15``, ``20``, ``25`` or ``30``; anything else raises "
"``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Laju data keluaran magnetometer dalam Hz. Harus salah satu dari ``2``\\ , "
"``6``\\ , ``8``\\ , ``10``\\ , ``15``\\ , ``20``\\ , ``25`` atau ``30``\\ ; "
"nilai lainnya akan memunculkan ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:57
msgid ""
"Poll the data-ready flag and return the raw signed ``(x, y, z, hall)`` "
"readings as integers, with the sub-LSB bits already shifted out. Raises "
"``OSError(\"Data not ready\")`` if no sample becomes available within ten "
"retries."
msgstr ""
"Polling flag siap-data dan kembalikan pembacaan mentah bertanda ``(x, y, z, "
"hall)`` sebagai bilangan bulat, dengan bit sub-LSB yang sudah digeser "
"keluar. Memunculkan ``OSError(\"Data not ready\")`` jika tidak ada sampel "
"yang tersedia dalam sepuluh percobaan ulang."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:64
msgid ""
"Read a fresh sample via :meth:`magnet_raw` and return the compensated "
"magnetic-field vector ``(x, y, z)``. The compensation uses the trim values "
"read at construction and matches the reference C driver supplied by Bosch."
msgstr ""
"Baca sampel baru melalui :meth:`magnet_raw` dan kembalikan vektor medan "
"magnet yang telah dikompensasi ``(x, y, z)``\\ . Kompensasi menggunakan "
"nilai trim yang dibaca saat konstruksi dan cocok dengan driver C referensi "
"yang disediakan oleh Bosch."
